SDF hand evidence — licences

This directory holds renders of the procedural SDF hand
(src/shared/python/model_appearance/hand_backends/sdf_hand.py, issue #15155,
epic #15150).

The hand is generated in-repo from scripts/config/sdf_hand.json. No MANO,
SMPL-X, or other third-party hand mesh is shipped or baked into these images.
Contact physics stay on the existing capsules; these meshes are visual only.

Runtime dependencies used to produce a mesh and a PNG:

- NumPy — BSD-3-Clause
- SciPy — BSD-3-Clause
- scikit-image (marching cubes) — BSD-3-Clause
- Matplotlib (PNG writer) — Matplotlib License (BSD-compatible)

Skin colour is the repo skin_2 entry in src/config/appearance_defaults.json,
not a scanned texture.
